// The runtime call that stores one captured value into a closure's cell. A cell
// that holds a list is stored with id_clo_setl, which records in the closure
// that the cell is a list the closure alone owns (the copy bind made), so
// id_clo_free can give it back with the object; every other cell is plain
// id_clo_set. Both targets spell the call from the type of the parameter the
// value fixes.

clo_setter(string pt) {
  string s = "id_clo_set";
  if(ty_is_list(pt) == 1) {
    s = "id_clo_setl";
  }
} return string s;
("int[]"):("id_clo_setl")
("string"):("id_clo_set")
